//! id: wma
//! name: WMA
//! decoder: audio
//! accepts: codec in [wmav1, wmav2, wmapro, wmalossless, wmavoice]
//! packet: 2 MiB
//! attribute: 1, libraryVersion
//! error: 1, input
//! error: 2, send
//! error: 3, receive
//! error: 4, sampleFormat
//! error: 5, option
//! error: 6, output
//! error: 7, waveFormat
//! error: 8, formatTag
//! error: 9, open
//! error: 10, unconfigured

The manifest of the WMA decoder package; the keys and codes are the ones ffmpeg_wma_bridge.c declares.
